  "question": {
    "text": "A person standing on the bank of a river observes that the angle of elevation of the top of a tree on the opposite bank of the river is $60^{\\circ}$ and when he retires 40 meter away from the tree the angle of elevation becomes $30^{\\circ}$. The breadth of the river is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "GnSJU",
      "text": "\n$20 \\mathrm{~m}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "Yiqgp",
      "text": "\n$30 \\mathrm{~m}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Gkgjc",
      "text": "\n$40 \\mathrm{~m}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "83kKO",
      "text": "\n$60 \\mathrm{~m}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\tan 30^{\\circ}=\\frac{h}{40+b}$\n$\\Rightarrow \\sqrt{3} h=40+b$\n$\\tan 60^{\\circ}=h / b \\Rightarrow h=\\sqrt{3} b$\n$\\Rightarrow b=20 m$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8908LxLh_SzHV8wbZr86un6eod_MDSVWRd2AdLRM5ZA.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
